          <p class="ja-sublabel" style="margin:12px 0 0">{t("サドグル公認ハタヨガ講師 ／ 健康経営プログラム", "Sadhguru-certified Hatha Yoga teacher / Corporate wellness programs")}</p>
          <div style="margin-top:30px">
            <div class="sc-rise" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:44px minmax(0,1fr);gap:16px;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(208,138,94,.42)"><span class="font-mono" style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:rgba(150,86,44,.8)">01</span><span><span class="font-display" style="display:block;font-size:20px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--yl-text)">{t("サドグル公認ハタヨガ講師", "Sadhguru-certified Hatha Yoga teacher")}</span><span style="display:block;margin-top:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--yl-soft)">{t("この資格を持つ日本人はわずか6名。そのうちの1人。", "One of only six Japanese people with this certification.")}</span></span></div><div class="sc-rise" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:44px minmax(0,1fr);gap:16px;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(208,138,94,.42)"><span class="font-mono" style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:rgba(150,86,44,.8)">02</span><span><span class="font-display" style="display:block;font-size:20px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--yl-text)">{t("インドで1年半の修行", "A year and a half of training in India")}</span><span style="display:block;margin-top:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--yl-soft)">{t("1,750時間超の集中トレーニングを修了。", "Completed more than 1,750 hours of intensive training.")}</span></span></div><div class="sc-rise" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:44px minmax(0,1fr);gap:16px;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(208,138,94,.42)"><span class="font-mono" style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:rgba(150,86,44,.8)">03</span><span><span class="font-display" style="display:block;font-size:20px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--yl-text)">{t("その前は13年間、米国のジャズ界で", "Previously, 13 years in the U.S. jazz world")}</span><span style="display:block;margin-top:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--yl-soft)">{t("作曲家・プロミュージシャンとして活動。伝える力と表現力。", "Worked as a composer and professional musician, developing communication and expressive skills.")}</span></span></div><div class="sc-rise" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:44px minmax(0,1fr);gap:16px;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(208,138,94,.42);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(208,138,94,.42)"><span class="font-mono" style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:rgba(150,86,44,.8)">04</span><span><span class="font-display" style="display:block;font-size:20px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--yl-text)">{t("科学に裏づけられたヨガ系統", "A yoga tradition supported by science")}</span><span style="display:block;margin-top:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--yl-soft)">{t("ハーバードの研究対象と同じ系統のハタヨガを指導。", "Teaches Hatha Yoga from the same tradition studied by Harvard researchers.")}</span></span></div>
